        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agents): make model-facing tool schemas llama.cpp GBNF-compatible",
        "body": "Fixes #108367\nFixes #108473\nFixes #108580\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nWhen OpenClaw runs against a llama.cpp `llama-server` with grammar-constrained tool calling, **every** chat request fails with a `400` as soon as grammar-hostile fields appear in the active tool list — not just cron calls. [#108580](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/108580) documents three distinct GBNF blockers (each masking the next):\n\n1. **Unanchored pattern** — `declarationKey` used `pattern: \"\\\\S\"` → `Pattern must start with '^' and end with '$'`.\n2. **PCRE shorthand** — even anchored `^\\\\S+$` or `^[\\\\s\\\\S]*\\\\S[\\\\s\\\\S]*$` fails; llama.cpp rejects `\\\\S`/`\\\\s` unknown escapes.\n3. **Oversized maxLength** — `trigger.script` `maxLength: 65536` exceeds the ~2000 GBNF repetition ceiling.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nServer-side validation constraints were baked into schemas that also serve as the model's **decoding grammar**. This PR removes grammar-hostile `pattern`/`maxLength` from **model-facing** tool schemas only (`src/agents/tools/*`):\n\n| Field | Removed from model schema | Still enforced by |\n|---|---|---|\n| `cron` `job.declarationKey` | `pattern: \"\\\\S\"` | cron gateway handler + RPC `CronDeclarationKeySchema` |\n| `cron` `trigger.script` (job + patch) | `maxLength: 65536` | RPC `CronTriggerSchema` |\n| `spawn_task` `prompt` / `cwd` | `maxLength: 32768` / `4096` | RPC task-suggestions params |\n| `sessions_search` `query` | `maxLength: 4096` | runtime execute-path guard |\n\n`packages/gateway-protocol/src/schema/cron.ts` is **intentionally unchanged** (RPC contract only; never compiled into model grammar).\n\n## User Impact\n\nUsers on llama.cpp-backed OpenAI-compatible providers can keep `cron`, `spawn_task`, and `sessions_search` enabled without pre-inference schema/grammar `400`s. Server-side validation unchanged for normal inputs.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Regression guard\n`src/agents/tools/tool-schema-llamacpp-compat.test.ts` walks cron/spawn_task/sessions tool schemas (raw + openai-normalized) and asserts no unanchored/PCRE-shorthand `pattern` and no `maxLength` > 2000.\n\n### Focused tests (local, head `8bad86f1dd4`)\n```bash\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/agents/tools/tool-schema-llamacpp-compat.test.ts \\\n  src/agents/tools/cron-tool.schema.test.ts test/scripts/prompt-snapshots.test.ts\n```\n15 passed; `pnpm prompt:snapshots:check` current.\n\n### Live llama.cpp before/after proof (local)\nEnvironment: `llama-server` b9960 (Homebrew), `ibm-granite/granite-4.1-3b-GGUF:Q4_K_M`, `--jinja`, OpenAI-compatible `POST /v1/chat/completions` with the real OpenClaw cron tool schema (`normalizeToolParameterSchema`, `modelProvider: openai`).\n\n```\nllama.cpp endpoint: http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1\nfixed declarationKey: {\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Idempotent declaration key.\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":200}\nfixed trigger.script: {\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"description\":\"Trigger script source (max 65536 chars).\"}\n\n=== BROKEN: unanchored declarationKey pattern \\\\S (shipped 2026.7.1) ===\nHTTP 400\nerror_preview: {\"error\":{\"code\":400,\"message\":\"Unable to generate parser for this template. Automatic parser generation failed: JSON schema conversion failed:\\nPattern must start with '^' and end with '$'\",\"type\":\"invalid_request_error\"}}\n\n=== BROKEN: trigger.script maxLength 65536 (#108580 constraint 3) ===\nHTTP 400\nerror_preview: {\"error\":{\"code\":400,\"message\":\"Failed to initialize samplers: failed to parse grammar\",\"type\":\"invalid_request_error\"}}\n\n=== FIXED: current PR model-facing cron schema ===\nHTTP 200\ninference_ok: true\nreply_preview: Hello! How can I help you today?\n```\n\n**Interpretation:** shipped schema fails with the exact errors reported in #108473/#108580; this PR's model-facing schema compiles and reaches inference (HTTP 200).\n\n### vs #108671\nSame model-facing GBNF strategy as @wsyjh8's #108671. This PR adds live before/after `llama-server` proof and is rebased on current `main` with green CI (including `check-lint` after #108857 discord test split landed on main).\n",
        "branch": "fix/cron-schema-anchored-patterns",
